---
description: 
globs: 
alwaysApply: true
---

- All color references should use reference colors from [ThemeColors.ts](mdc:apps/word-for-word/src/constants/ThemeColors.ts) directly, for the purposes of dark mode compatibility, instead of tailwind colors. This means using `style` property to style the components.
- However, we must use tailwind for all styling as far as possible. (Some components like gorhom's `BottomSheet` components don't respond to tailwind classes).
- Always use `yarn add` instead of `npm install` as we are in a monorepo (yarn workspaces)
